{"strongs": "H2167", "word": "זמר", "translit": "za.mar", "root": "זלפה", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "make music", "definition": "I. [ זמר ] verb only Pi`el make music in praise of God ( ׳ י ), only in poetry (Arabic pipe, play on a reed; Aramaic , זַמֵּר and derivatives; Ethiopic in derived conjugations; on an original meaning hum, murmur , compare Hup ZKM iii, (1840) 394 ff. iv, 139 ff. Id Psalm. Einl. § 7, 2 De 4 on Ps 3 ) — Pi`el Imperfect 3 masculine singular suffix יְזַמֶּרְךָ Ps 30:13 1 singular אֲזַמֵּר Judg 5:3 ; 2Sam 22:50 (וַ)אֲזַמְּרָה Ps 7:18 + 7 t., אֲזַמֵּ֑רָה Ps 18:50 + 3 t.; suffix אֲזַמֶּרְךָ Ps 57:10 ; Ps 108:4 , אֲזַמְּרֶ֑ךָּ Ps 131:1 3 masculine plural יְזַמְּרוּ Ps 66:4 ; Ps 149:3 וִיזַמְּרוּ Ps 66:4 1 plural נְזַמְּרָה Ps 21:14 Imperative masculine plural זַמְּרוּ Ps 9:12 + 14 t., זַמֵּ֑רוּ Ps 47:7 (twice in verse); Infinitive לְזַמֵּר Ps 92:2 , זַמְּרָה Ps 147:1 — make music, melody (only Psalms, except Judg 5:3 ; Isa 12:5 ); — 1. of singing to ( ל ) God (Yahweh) Judg 5:3 ; Ps 27:6 ; Ps 101:1 ; Ps 104:33 ; Ps 105:2 = 1Chr 16:9 (all || שׁיר verb), Ps 9:12 ; Ps 30:5 (both || הוֺדוּ ), Ps 47:7 ( לְמַלְכֵּנוּ ), Ps 66:4 ; Ps 71:23 (with תְּרַנֵּנָּה שְׂפָתַי ), Ps 75:10 (|| הגיד ), Ps 146:2 (|| הלל ); followed by אֶלִֿ Ps 59:18 to his name לשׁם , Ps 18:50 = 2Sam 22:50 (|| אודך ), Ps 92:2 (|| לְהֹדוֺת ), Ps 135:3 (|| הללויה ); followed by suffix = sing thee, praise thee in song Ps 30:13 ; Ps 57:10 ; Ps 108:4 ; Ps 138:1 (all || אודך ); followed by acc ׳ י Isa 12:5 , אלהים Ps 47:7 , אלהינו Ps 147:1 , אדני Ps 68:33 (|| שׁירו ), followed by שְׁמוֺ Ps 7:18 (|| אודה ), Ps 9:3 ; Ps 61:9 ; Ps 66:4 ; Ps 68:5 (|| שׁידו ); followed by כְּבוֺד שְׁמוֺ Ps 66:2 , גבורתך Ps 21:14 (|| נשׁירה ); followed by accusative of the song, מַשְׂכִּיל Ps 47:8 (see ׳ מ below שׂכל ); absolute Ps 57:8 (|| אשׁירה ), Ps 98:4 (|| הָרִיעוּ , פִּצְחוּ , רַנְַנוּ ), Ps 108:2 (|| אשׁירה ; instrumental accompare v Ps 108:3 compare also v Ps 108:4 above ), Ps 47:7 (twice in